# Storybook stories

- Add a story for each meaningful visual state driven by props (Chromatic relies on this).
- Prefer CSF3 (`Meta` / `StoryObj`) and keep `args` focused on the state under test.
- Compose with real parent triggers when needed (`DialogTrigger`, `Provider` for v3).

```tsx
const meta: Meta<typeof AlertDialog> = {
  component: AlertDialog,
  parameters: {layout: 'centered'},
  title: 'AlertDialog'
};
export default meta;

export const Example: StoryObj<typeof AlertDialog> = {
  render: (args) => (
    <DialogTrigger>
      <ActionButton>Open</ActionButton>
      <AlertDialog {...args}>Body</AlertDialog>
    </DialogTrigger>
  ),
  args: {title: '...', primaryActionLabel: 'Confirm'}
};
```

- **v3**: `yarn start` → http://localhost:9003 (`.storybook`)
- **S2**: `yarn start:s2` → http://localhost:6006 (`.storybook-s2`)
